# U2RE-toolset

VS Code/Cursor extension (`u2re-dev`, commands `vext.*`). Chromium-class host.
Entry: `src/extension.mjs`. Do not treat this tree as a fest workspace.

## Locate

1. Read `.cursor/maps/index.md`.
2. Open one mapped file; grep there first.
3. Repo-wide search last. Skip `dist/`, `out/`, `artifacts/`, `node_modules/`.

Durable facts: `.cursor/memory.md` — read or append only when a fact must survive this chat (cap ~40 lines). Do not copy maps into memory.

## Invariants

- One canonical implementation; no parallel helpers.
- Preserve behavior unless the task asks to change it.
- Small, reviewable diffs. Ask if consolidation is ambiguous.

